<title>ISRAEL: IDB Development 3Q loss 3.6 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>IDB Development 3Q loss 3.6 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's IDB Development Corp, a subsidiary of IDB Holdings Corp, reported the following results to the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange</p>
<p>				   (in thousands of shekels)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96     Q3 95    9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Income		  419,941   508,256  1,246,897   1,234,315</p>
<p>Pre-tax Income	 47,509   159,945    279,448     337,527</p>
<p>Net Profit	  Loss3,618    58,744    112,522     123,333</p>
<p>($1=3.25 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
